{"question_id": "ntce.zhongxue.zonghe.2012b.q27", "exam": "NTCE", "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "zonghe", "source": {"type": "真题", "system": "国考", "session": "2012b", "paper": null, "variant": "全卷", "origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2012年下半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（中学）真题.csv", "verified": true}, "section": "单项选择题", "question_type": "单选", "material_id": null, "score": null, "content": {"stem": "下列选项中，对概念所作概括，正确的一项是（ ）。", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "将“启明星”概括为“太白星”"}, {"key": "B", "text": "将“火焰山”概括为“吐鲁番”"}, {"key": "C", "text": "将“中国文学”概括为“艺术哲学”"}, {"key": "D", "text": "将“长篇小说”概括为“文学作品”"}], "answer": "D", "answer_status": "letter", "analysis": null}, "knowledge_node_ids": [], "difficulty": null, "review": {"status": "待复核", "tagger": null, "checked_by": null}, "extra": {"duplicate_of": "ntce.youer.zonghe.2012b.q27", "paper_order": 27}}
